	d in the Ticketmaster app will be valid for this event. States Blocking Ar
	tist Resale Terms New York\, Illinois\, Colorado\, Virginia\, Utah and Con
	necticut have state laws that prevent resale restrictions. In those states
	\, tickets can be transferred but Ticketmaster will still honor PRESIDENT'
	s terms by keeping resale prices at face value on its site.\n\nhttps://www
